# Privacy Policy / 隐私政策

**Last Updated / 最后更新日期：January 2025 / 2025年1月**

---

## English Version

### Overview

FastMoss Data Export Assistant ("this extension") takes your privacy seriously. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.

### Data Collection

**What data do we collect?**

**We do NOT collect any personal data.**

This extension runs entirely in your local browser and does NOT:
- Collect your personal information
- Upload any data to our servers
- Track your browsing behavior
- Store your account information
- Share data with third parties

### Local Data Processing

This extension only accesses data when:
- You actively use the extension features
- Only accesses the currently open FastMoss webpage
- All data processing is done locally in your browser
- Exported data files are saved directly to your device

### Permission Explanations

This extension requests the following permissions:

**activeTab**
- **Purpose**: Access the currently open FastMoss tab
- **Scope**: Only active when you click the extension icon
- **Data**: Only reads page URL and ID information

**scripting**
- **Purpose**: Execute data scraping functions
- **Scope**: Only runs on FastMoss websites (*.fastmoss.com)
- **Data**: Only used for API requests and data export

**host_permissions**
- **Purpose**: Access FastMoss API interfaces
- **Scope**: Limited to https://*.fastmoss.com/*
- **Data**: Only sends necessary API requests, does not store response data

### Data Storage

**Local Storage**

This extension may use browser local storage (localStorage) to:
- Remember your date range preferences (optional)
- Temporarily store scraping progress information

**All data is stored only on your device and is not synced to the cloud.**

### Third-Party Services

This extension does not integrate any third-party analytics services, advertising services, or tracking tools.

### Data Security

- All data processing is done locally
- No network transmission involved (except API requests)
- No sensitive information stored
- Export files saved directly to your device

### Children's Privacy

This extension is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

### Privacy Policy Updates

We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Significant changes will be notified to users when the extension is updated.

### Contact Us

If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact:
- Development Team: Anker Oceanwing IDC Team

### Consent

By using this extension, you agree to the terms of this privacy policy.

---

**This extension fully respects your privacy. All features run locally and will not leak any of your information.**

